+# Forensic Security Model, Cryptographic Assets & Entry Points Audit (KAN-320)
+
+**Date**: 2026-11-22  
+**Epic**: KAN-320 (`[EPIC][KB-SECURITY-MODEL-DOCS-AUDIT]`)  
+**Auditor**: b-kan320 (Paranoiac Security & Systems Architect)  
